1
00:00:01,620 --> 00:00:03,260
你把内脏都放盘子里了吗
You put the giblets in a pan?

2
00:00:03,720 --> 00:00:04,120
是的 主厨
Yes, chef.

3
00:00:04,120 --> 00:00:06,373
谢谢 一个名叫副厨的男孩
Thanks, a boy named sous...chef.

4
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:08,760
我不懂什么意思 但我信你的梗
I don't get it, but I trust you.

5
00:00:09,180 --> 00:00:09,780
好了 菲利普
All right, Philip,

6
00:00:09,960 --> 00:00:11,940
把翅尖塞到火鸡肚子下面
tuck the wing tips under the body of the bird

7
00:00:11,940 --> 00:00:13,500
然后放到烤盘上
and place in a roasting pan.

8
00:00:13,680 --> 00:00:15,740
遵命 我的女神
As you wish, my crumpet.

9
00:00:16,020 --> 00:00:18,380
今年的感恩节晚宴由我掌勺
I am cooking Thanksgiving dinner this year.

10
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:20,900
让克莱尔信赖我的厨艺真的不容易
Huge step for Claire to trust me with this.

11
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:22,876
但我有帮手 就是这个新应用
But I have help -- this new app.

12
00:00:22,876 --> 00:00:26,000
国际知名的大厨奈洁拉·劳森
It's, uh, international super chef Nigella Lawson.

13
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:27,120
我还可以编入我的名字
I can even program my name,

14
00:00:27,120 --> 00:00:28,140
就好像她站在我旁边
so it's like she's right here

15
00:00:28,140 --> 00:00:30,260
用她性感的英式嗓音一步步指导我
guiding my every move with that sultry British voice.

16
00:00:31,260 --> 00:00:32,520
我上周在车里听到她的
I listened to her meringue instructions

17
00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:33,520
蛋白酥皮指南
in the car last week.

18
00:00:34,120 --> 00:00:34,680
各种搅拌[鞭打]
There was so much

19
00:00:34,680 --> 00:00:36,080
害我不得不在路边停下车
whipping and beating I had to pull over.

20
00:00:36,940 --> 00:00:38,640
-进展如何 -很顺利
- How's it going in here? - Great.

21
00:00:38,760 --> 00:00:40,660
你好好享受这个感恩节吧 终于不用
You just take advantage of your first Thanksgiving

22
00:00:40,660 --> 00:00:42,500
在热滚滚的烤炉边汗流浃背
not sweating over a hot stove

23
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:43,720
最后坐下来吃晚餐时 一身油腻
and having to sit down to dinner

24
00:00:43,720 --> 00:00:46,060
脾气暴躁又筋疲力尽
all gross and grumpy and exhausted.

25
00:00:46,340 --> 00:00:48,377
是啊 今年你终于可以有一份好心情了
Yeah, this year, you can finally be in a good mood.

26
00:00:48,377 --> 00:00:50,680
听你们这番话之前 我确实心情很好
Well, I was until this little riff.

27
00:00:50,680 --> 00:00:52,400
我妈和杰从墨西哥发来了感恩节问候
Mom and Jay sent a Thanksgiving greeting from Mexico.

28
00:00:52,760 --> 00:00:54,700
我都不知道墨西哥也过感恩节
I didn't even know Mexico had Thanksgiving.

29
00:00:55,020 --> 00:00:56,531
就是 我刚才也这么说来着
I know. I said the same thing.

30
00:00:56,531 --> 00:00:58,080
天啊 我们会很想念艾丽克斯的
God, we're really gonna miss Alex.

31
00:00:58,080 --> 00:01:00,235
我还是不理解你为什么要放弃免费旅行
I still don't get why you passed up a free trip.

32
00:01:00,235 --> 00:01:02,320
因为他们得跟23个哥伦比亚人见面
Because they're meeting 23 Colombians

33
00:01:02,320 --> 00:01:04,980
他们管我妈叫"安静的美女子"
who call my mom "La Tranquila" -- the quiet one.

34
00:01:05,780 --> 00:01:06,740
你们好啊 我的家人们
Hola, familia!

35
00:01:07,220 --> 00:01:07,840
感恩节快乐
Happy Thanksgiving!

36
00:01:08,060 --> 00:01:09,800
祝你明天生日快乐 卢克
Happy birthday tomorrow, Luke!

37
00:01:10,020 --> 00:01:11,420
卢克 我们没忘记你哦
Yeah, Luke, we didn't forget about you.

38
00:01:11,460 --> 00:01:13,280
我们在墨西哥给你买了个超棒的礼物
We got you a great present here in Mexico.

39
00:01:13,580 --> 00:01:14,840
回去后见咯
See you when we get back.

40
00:01:15,080 --> 00:01:16,760
拜拜 拜拜
Bye! Bye-bye!

41
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:17,980
再见
See you soon!

42
00:01:18,540 --> 00:01:19,300
卡
And cut.

43
00:01:19,640 --> 00:01:20,940
我想他们会信的
Well, I think we sold that.

44
00:01:22,243 --> 00:01:23,980
哥伦比亚之旅取消了
The Colombians' trip got canceled

45
00:01:23,980 --> 00:01:26,660
因为当地机场跑道发生了泥石流
because a mudslide took out the runway at the local airport.

46
00:01:26,660 --> 00:01:27,840
那里都是用土建起来的
That thing's made of dirt.

47
00:01:27,900 --> 00:01:29,000
你确定不是只是下雨而已吗
Are we sure it didn't just rain?

48
00:01:29,260 --> 00:01:30,220
所以我们根本没走成
So we never left,

49
00:01:30,220 --> 00:01:32,060
我们本来要去菲尔和克莱尔家的 但是
and we could have gone to Phil and Claire's, but...

50
00:01:32,060 --> 00:01:34,340
我们决定自己在家享受
We decided to enjoy our own quiet,

51
00:01:35,040 --> 00:01:36,880
安宁轻松的节日晚宴 不让任何人知道
stress-free holiday dinner at home with no one the wiser.

52
00:01:36,880 --> 00:01:38,800
我们要享受牛排假日
We're having a little steak-cation,

53
00:01:38,800 --> 00:01:41,169
但是吃的是火鸡 不是牛排
only with turkey instead of the steak.

54
00:01:41,169 --> 00:01:42,771
是留宅假日[Stay和Steak音似]
Stay-cation.

55
00:01:42,771 --> 00:01:45,659
-我说的什么 -牛排假日
- What did I say? - "Steak-cation."

56
00:01:45,702 --> 00:01:47,860
是留宅假日
It's stay-cation.

57
00:01:47,860 --> 00:01:49,240
你想用一堂英语课
Oh, so, this is how you want to start

58
00:01:49,240 --> 00:01:52,300
来开启安宁轻松的晚餐吗
the quiet, stress-free dinner, with an English lesson?

59
00:01:55,765 --> 00:01:57,508
他们管她叫"安静的美女子"
They call her "La Tranquila."

60
00:02:09,960 --> 00:02:13,560
我们一定要记得把这个背包还给莉莉
We really need to remember to return this backpack to Lily.

61
00:02:14,640 --> 00:02:15,760
亲爱的 别忘了
Oh, and, honey,

62
00:02:15,940 --> 00:02:18,380
米奇尔不喜欢吃葡萄干
don't forget Mitchell hates raisins.

63
00:02:18,380 --> 00:02:18,970
所以你填火鸡的时候 一点都不能
So when you're making the stuffing, you can't put any --

64
00:02:19,820 --> 00:02:22,080
我知道让你移交管辖权很难
I know how hard it is for you to hand over the reins,

65
00:02:22,100 --> 00:02:23,600
但你得相信我
but you have got to trust me.

66
00:02:23,600 --> 00:02:24,440
我相信你
I do trust you.

67
00:02:24,440 --> 00:02:26,160
只是这些小细节很容易忘嘛
It's just easy to forget the little things.

68
00:02:26,260 --> 00:02:28,180
我什么也不会忘的
I'm not going to forget anything.

69
00:02:28,180 --> 00:02:30,340
走吧
Now go.

70
00:02:31,260 --> 00:02:32,720
你俩快去一趟杂货店
You two need to run to the grocery store.

71
00:02:32,780 --> 00:02:34,320
我忘记买绿豆 番薯和蔓越莓酱了
I forgot green beans, yams, and cranberry sauce.

72
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:39,760
婴儿床里藏着什么[偷偷摸摸]
What's in the crib?

73
00:02:40,241 --> 00:02:42,360
什么偷偷摸摸 你才偷偷摸摸
What crib? You're a crib.

74
00:02:42,360 --> 00:02:43,200
你不是应该在学习嘛
Shouldn't you be studying?

75
00:02:43,380 --> 00:02:44,980
期中考都结束了
Well, I'm done with my midterms.

76
00:02:45,100 --> 00:02:46,480
大学申请论文也写完了
I finished my college essay.

77
00:02:46,480 --> 00:02:48,120
我正打算出去骑自行车
And I was just about to go on a bike ride.

78
00:02:48,640 --> 00:02:50,000
你怎么一副犯了错的样子
Why are you acting so guilty?

79
00:02:50,180 --> 00:02:50,980
你才犯了错
You're guilty.

80
00:02:50,980 --> 00:02:53,100
我是怎么成为优秀辩手的
How did I ever get to be a champion debater?

81
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:57,600
是备用火鸡啦
It is a backup turkey.

82
00:02:57,720 --> 00:03:00,240
我怕你爸爸做得不好吃才买的
I bought it in case your father's doesn't work out,

83
00:03:00,240 --> 00:03:01,460
我希望他做得好吃
which I hope it does.

84
00:03:01,480 --> 00:03:02,360
但万一不好吃
But if it doesn't,

85
00:03:02,560 --> 00:03:04,380
这只可以让他免于难堪
this could save him a lot of embarrassment.

86
00:03:05,080 --> 00:03:06,060
请别告诉他
Please don't tell him.

87
00:03:06,080 --> 00:03:08,340
如果他以为我不信任他 会气死的
He would die if he thought I didn't trust him.

88
00:03:08,840 --> 00:03:09,211
有意思
Interesting.

89
00:03:09,211 --> 00:03:11,520
我很快都要去上大学了
I mean, I'm going off to college soon.

90
00:03:11,520 --> 00:03:12,060
你却突然间
All of a sudden,

91
00:03:12,060 --> 00:03:14,460
在我的旧婴儿床里放热乎的东西
you're keeping something warm in my old crib.

92
00:03:16,560 --> 00:03:18,335
来吧 亲爱的 你会更喜欢这个
Here you go, sweetie. You'll like this better.

93
00:03:18,335 --> 00:03:19,680
天啊 你开玩笑呢吗
Oh, my gosh. You got to be kidding me.

94
00:03:19,680 --> 00:03:20,520
别再这样了
Not this again.

95
00:03:20,520 --> 00:03:22,480
什么 她说煎蛋太水了
What? She said her eggs were watery,

96
00:03:22,480 --> 00:03:23,920
所以我给她做了华夫饼
so I made her a waffle.

97
00:03:24,060 --> 00:03:25,120
别小题大做
Please don't make a thing out of it.

98
00:03:25,120 --> 00:03:26,260
我见过你把吃的退回去
I've seen you send food back.

99
00:03:26,320 --> 00:03:27,320
还记得迈阿密那次吗
Remember that time in Miami?

100
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:28,880
首先 这里不是饭店
Okay, first of all, this isn't a restaurant.

101
00:03:29,040 --> 00:03:30,640
其次 那是因为那份浓汤里有一颗牙
Secondly, my bisque had a tooth in it.

102
00:03:30,640 --> 00:03:31,620
是贝壳
It was a shell.

103
00:03:31,760 --> 00:03:33,380
那是实心的
There was a filling in it.

104
00:03:33,740 --> 00:03:35,700
我不想吃华夫饼
Ugh, I don't feel like waffles.

105
00:03:35,900 --> 00:03:37,263
能不能帮我弄麦片
Can you make me cereal?

106
00:03:37,263 --> 00:03:38,520
-当然 -坚决不行
- Sure. - Absolutely not.

107
00:03:38,520 --> 00:03:40,397
绝对不行 莉莉
Absolutely not, Lily.

108
00:03:40,397 --> 00:03:41,661
把华夫饼吃完
You are gonna finish that waffle,

109
00:03:41,661 --> 00:03:43,100
不然就什么都没得吃
or you're not gonna have breakfast.

110
00:03:43,100 --> 00:03:44,816
那我边看电视边吃总可以吧
Can I at least eat it in front of the TV?

111
00:03:44,816 --> 00:03:46,202
-可以 -不行
- Yes. - No.

112
00:03:46,440 --> 00:03:47,240
谢谢爸爸
Thanks, daddy.

113
00:03:47,740 --> 00:03:48,480
坏爸爸
Mean daddy.

114
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:50,200
好吧 好吧
Okay, okay.

115
00:03:50,200 --> 00:03:52,640
她每次想要什么你都给 我成了坏爸爸
You give in to her every whim, and I'm mean daddy.

116
00:03:52,680 --> 00:03:54,360
-才没有 -是吗
- That's not true. - Isn't it?

117
00:03:55,240 --> 00:03:56,040
那这是什么
What's this?

118
00:03:56,740 --> 00:03:57,820
这就是我们在她眼里的样子
This is how she sees us.

119
00:03:57,940 --> 00:03:59,239
我是个尖叫的魔鬼
I'm a screaming demon,

120
00:03:59,239 --> 00:04:01,501
你就是快乐小天使
and you're just a-smilin' and a-bakin'.

121
00:04:02,220 --> 00:04:02,880
顺便说下
And, incidentally,

122
00:04:02,880 --> 00:04:04,400
真有必要把这贴冰箱上吗
do we really think this is refrigerator-worthy?

123
00:04:04,480 --> 00:04:07,040
昨天你让她整理房间后她贴上去的
She put it up yesterday after you made her clean her room.

124
00:04:07,060 --> 00:04:08,360
而你给她做了布朗尼蛋糕
And after you made her brownies.

125
00:04:08,520 --> 00:04:11,020
你要是还不对她严一点
She is gonna turn into a willful, fat little girl

126
00:04:11,020 --> 00:04:12,520
她会变成一个任性的小胖子的
unless you start getting tough with her,

127
00:04:12,560 --> 00:04:13,859
现在你是她的小伙伴
because right now you're her pal,

128
00:04:13,859 --> 00:04:16,660
我就是拿着叉子的妖受
and I'm just the pitchfork-wielding she-devil.

129
00:04:18,946 --> 00:04:19,820
我跟画里对上了 是吧
It lined up, didn't it?

130
00:04:19,820 --> 00:04:21,960
是啊 你拿着叉子简直大亮
Yeah, we really got lucky with you holding that fork.

131
00:04:22,460 --> 00:04:23,240
长话短说
Long story short.

132
00:04:23,300 --> 00:04:25,500
要是用倒的 就是蔓越莓酱
If you pour it, it's cranberry sauce.

133
00:04:25,600 --> 00:04:27,160
要是用切的 不好意思
But I'm sorry, if you slice it,

134
00:04:27,160 --> 00:04:28,180
就成蔓越莓果冻了
it's cranberry jelly.

135
00:04:28,380 --> 00:04:31,300
我已经踩足了油门了
I'm literally driving as fast as this car can go.

136
00:04:32,160 --> 00:04:33,600
你袖子里那个是袜子吗
Is that a sock in your sleeve?

137
00:04:34,400 --> 00:04:36,360
我今早在你家洗衣服
I did laundry at your house this morning,

138
00:04:36,360 --> 00:04:37,700
可你们没有除静电纸
and you have no dryer sheets.

139
00:04:38,040 --> 00:04:39,100
我喜欢住在你们家
I like staying with you,

140
00:04:39,100 --> 00:04:40,200
不过这就跟野营一样
but it's basically camping.

141
00:04:42,946 --> 00:04:44,280
对不起
I'm -- I'm so sorry!

142
00:04:44,280 --> 00:04:45,217
我什么也没感觉到
I didn't feel anything.

143
00:04:45,217 --> 00:04:47,206
我是说 我当然有感觉到
I mean, of -- of course I felt something,

144
00:04:47,206 --> 00:04:48,152
你显然很有料 我是说
and you do have them -- I mean --

145
00:04:48,152 --> 00:04:49,460
你怎么不按喇叭
Why didn't you honk?!

146
00:04:49,460 --> 00:04:50,780
那样不就更糟了吗
Wouldn't that have just made it worse?

147
00:04:52,820 --> 00:04:53,700
好了 菲利普
Now, Philip,

148
00:04:53,880 --> 00:04:56,380
用橄榄油按摩鸡胸和鸡腿
rub the breasts and thighs with olive oil.

149
00:04:56,480 --> 00:04:58,500
好吧 虽然我没怎么试过
I'm a little new at this, but okay.

150
00:04:58,920 --> 00:05:00,260
往火鸡里填料前
Before stuffing the bird,

151
00:05:00,320 --> 00:05:02,020
最好取下首饰
you may want to remove your jewelry.

152
00:05:02,540 --> 00:05:04,320
你是叫我摘掉婚戒吗
You mean take off my wedding ring?

153
00:05:05,040 --> 00:05:07,180
你实在太坏了
You bad, bad girl.

154
00:05:07,360 --> 00:05:08,380
你在跟谁说话
Who are you talking to?

155
00:05:08,380 --> 00:05:09,555
我 没有 谁啊
I was -- nothing. Who?

156
00:05:09,555 --> 00:05:11,140
我才不会舍弃二十年的
I'm not gonna throw away 20 years of --

157
00:05:11,140 --> 00:05:12,000
沙拉是不是糊了
Is the salad burning?

158
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:13,320
东西都买好了
Here's everything,

159
00:05:13,420 --> 00:05:15,760
包括你的所谓的蔓越莓酱
including your cranberry so-called sauce.

160
00:05:15,800 --> 00:05:16,420
速度好快
That was fast.

161
00:05:16,460 --> 00:05:18,160
我以每小时70英里的速度飞驶
I was driving 70 miles an hour.

162
00:05:18,740 --> 00:05:21,299
好了 菲利普 在鸡胸和鸡腿上
Now, Philip, cover the breast and legs

163
00:05:21,299 --> 00:05:23,260
包一层涂过黄油的干酪包布
with a buttered cheesecloth.

164
00:05:23,260 --> 00:05:24,620
那声音有点诡异
That thing's a little creepy.

165
00:05:24,700 --> 00:05:25,460
你才有点诡异
You're a little creepy.

166
00:05:27,760 --> 00:05:29,800
我不喜欢
I don't love being the person

167
00:05:29,800 --> 00:05:32,000
跟藏在摇篮里的备用火鸡躲在车库里
who hides in her garage with her secret crib turkey,

168
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:34,420
但做后备军本身就不是件有趣的事
but it's not always fun being the backstop.

169
00:05:34,660 --> 00:05:35,540
你还说呢
You're telling me.

170
00:05:35,760 --> 00:05:37,000
你每天下班回家之前
Until you get home from work every day,

171
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:38,800
我的主要工作就是让卢克好好活着
my main job is keeping Luke alive.

172
00:05:38,980 --> 00:05:41,034
有次我发现他在跑步机上玩剪刀
I actually caught him on the treadmill with scissors.

173
00:05:41,034 --> 00:05:43,000
你有没有嫉妒过他们
Do you ever feel jealous of them?

174
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:43,740
你也有过吗
You do, too?

175
00:05:43,880 --> 00:05:45,120
是啊 没断过
Oh, yeah, all the time.

176
00:05:45,120 --> 00:05:47,060
拜托 我们忙着收拾烂摊子的时候
Please, while you and I are busy being responsible,

177
00:05:48,060 --> 00:05:51,179
一号痴线和二号痴线正玩得开心呢
thing one and thing two are off having so much fun.

178
00:05:51,179 --> 00:05:54,879
拜托 价值十亿的点子
Ple-- "Billion-dollar ideas"?

179
00:05:55,938 --> 00:05:57,860
这不是"真感觉挠头器"吗
The real head scratcher "T.M."

180
00:05:57,860 --> 00:06:00,080
简直是经典
Now, that -- that is a classic.

181
00:06:05,080 --> 00:06:05,880
还有这个
Look at this.

182
00:06:06,640 --> 00:06:08,920
这是之前老爸用T恤喷射器给卢克改造的
Isn't that the old T-shirt cannon that dad modified for Luke

183
00:06:08,920 --> 00:06:09,840
那个送报纸工具吗
to take on his paper route?

184
00:06:09,840 --> 00:06:12,080
是啊 这主意很有趣 对吧
Yeah, it's a fun idea, huh?

185
00:06:13,919 --> 00:06:17,060
其实 我们完全可以放松放松
You know, there's no reason you and I can't relax a little

186
00:06:17,060 --> 00:06:18,600
像他们那样找点乐子
and have as much fun as they do.

187
00:06:19,040 --> 00:06:19,660
赞成
I'm in.

188
00:06:19,960 --> 00:06:21,318
我们也像他们一样犯犯傻
Let's be more like those idiots.

189
00:06:21,318 --> 00:06:25,140
对 车库犯傻快乐
Yeah. Con-garage-ulations.

190
00:06:25,140 --> 00:06:25,840
妥妥的
Nailed it.

191
00:06:26,720 --> 00:06:27,820
你们在干什么
What's going on in here?

192
00:06:28,552 --> 00:06:30,050
没什么 没什么
Um, n-nothing. Nothing.

193
00:06:30,050 --> 00:06:31,640
我们 不是看上去的那样
We -- it's not what it looks like.

194
00:06:31,640 --> 00:06:32,300
-真的 -真的
- Really? - No.

195
00:06:33,328 --> 00:06:35,080
看上去好像
'Cause what it looks like

196
00:06:35,120 --> 00:06:37,257
我掌勺后
is me taking over the cooking duties

197
00:06:37,257 --> 00:06:38,520
我的姑娘们终于可以
has allowed my girls here

198
00:06:38,520 --> 00:06:40,920
放放松 玩一玩了
to let down their hair and have fun for a change.

199
00:06:41,402 --> 00:06:44,803
你们把这陈年旧货都挖出来了
Looks like you even dug out the old news-zooka.

200
00:06:45,520 --> 00:06:46,480
哦不
Oh, no!

201
00:06:48,380 --> 00:06:50,314
你不是吧 又来
Oh, my god! Again?!

202
00:06:50,314 --> 00:06:51,540
那是意外
I-it was an accident!

203
00:06:51,540 --> 00:06:53,713
一次才能说是意外 色狼
Once is an accident, perv.

204
00:06:56,600 --> 00:06:58,420
宝贝 快点 该走了
Honey, come on. It's time to go.

205
00:06:58,760 --> 00:06:59,540
来了
I'm ready.

206
00:06:59,820 --> 00:07:00,680
不行 亲爱的
Oh, no, sweetie,

207
00:07:00,700 --> 00:07:02,600
穿我们给你新买的那件漂亮感恩节裙子吧
We bought you that pretty new Thanksgiving dress.

208
00:07:02,780 --> 00:07:03,900
可我想穿这身
But I want to wear this.

209
00:07:04,160 --> 00:07:05,900
她想穿这件衣服 卡梅隆
She wants to wear that, Cameron.

210
00:07:08,100 --> 00:07:08,580
你有什么想法
Thoughts?

211
00:07:10,179 --> 00:07:12,210
莉莉 我们都盛装打扮
Well, Lily, uh, we're all dressed up.

212
00:07:12,280 --> 00:07:14,040
你不希望表现得很失礼吧
You don't want to be disrespectful, do you?

213
00:07:14,160 --> 00:07:15,960
我应该可以想穿什么就穿什么
I should be able to wear what I want.

214
00:07:16,160 --> 00:07:17,440
好吧 亲爱的 听着
Okay, well, sweetie, listen,

215
00:07:17,500 --> 00:07:21,380
你如果不穿那裙子我们恐怕就不能走了
I'm afraid we can't leave until you put that dress on.

216
00:07:21,960 --> 00:07:22,440
好吧
Okay.

217
00:07:23,660 --> 00:07:24,620
看到了吗
You see?

218
00:07:24,880 --> 00:07:26,340
尽管你很想看到我大喊大叫
As much as you want me to yell,

219
00:07:26,340 --> 00:07:27,780
可我有更有效的办法
I have a more effective method.

220
00:07:27,880 --> 00:07:29,780
当你跟一个孩子说
When you say to a child,

221
00:07:30,720 --> 00:07:33,020
"我会给予你礼遇和尊重"
"I will treat you with dignity and respect,"

222
00:07:33,020 --> 00:07:35,980
那个孩子就会反过来对你说
that child will, in turn, say to you --

223
00:07:36,300 --> 00:07:38,600
我没摘下标签 周一就把它退回去
I left the tag on. This is going back Monday.

224
00:07:38,940 --> 00:07:40,520
就在你正酝酿盛气凌人的姿态时
Oh, and right in the middle of getting up

225
00:07:40,520 --> 00:07:41,489
给你一个下马威
on such a high, high horse.

226
00:07:41,489 --> 00:07:42,200
莉莉
Okay, Lily.

227
00:07:42,200 --> 00:07:43,160
你说穿上就行的
You said put it on.

228
00:07:43,160 --> 00:07:45,200
我穿上了 我们走吧
Well, it's on. Let's go.

229
00:07:46,400 --> 00:07:49,020
我们不能让她这样自作主张
We cannot let her run the show like this.

230
00:07:49,240 --> 00:07:51,060
好吧 相信我 我另有安排
Okay, trust me, I have another plan.

231
00:07:51,180 --> 00:07:51,920
真的吗 因为现在
Really? Because right now,

232
00:07:51,920 --> 00:07:53,800
我们的孩子就像越南版的安妮·霍尔
our child's walking around like a Vietnamese Annie Hall.

233
00:07:54,040 --> 00:07:56,740
米奇尔 我会让她明白 她说得不算
Mitchell, I will make it clear that she is not the boss.

234
00:07:57,600 --> 00:07:59,600
好吧 不不 我们现在不能出去
Okay, well, no, no, we can't go out now.

235
00:08:01,800 --> 00:08:03,960
她从哪学来的这烦人的习惯
Okay, where did she learn that annoying habit?

236
00:08:04,320 --> 00:08:06,080
克莱尔每周一都会去冥想班接她
Claire's been picking her up from meditation Mondays.

237
00:08:07,620 --> 00:08:09,560
小火鸡就快美美地出炉了
The little bird's coming along nicely.

238
00:08:10,000 --> 00:08:11,720
这可以成为我们新的感恩节传统
Hey, this could be our new Thanksgiving tradition.

239
00:08:11,880 --> 00:08:13,929
什么传统 躲避我们的家人吗
What, hiding from our own family?

240
00:08:13,929 --> 00:08:15,780
如果印第安人稍稍躲藏一点的话
Hey, if the Indians hid a little bit more,

241
00:08:15,780 --> 00:08:16,898
他们现在可能还拥有自己的国家
they might still have this country.

242
00:08:16,898 --> 00:08:19,000
不 只是远离大家 稍微清静一下
No, just taking a break from each other.

243
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:20,440
上帝知道我有多爱他们
God knows I couldn't love them more,

244
00:08:20,460 --> 00:08:22,760
不过肯尼迪家族也不像我们这样频繁见面
but the Kennedys didn't get together as much as this family.

245
00:08:22,860 --> 00:08:24,760
-所以你不觉得内疚吗 -内疚什么
- So you don't feel guilty? - For what?

246
00:08:25,040 --> 00:08:27,180
没跟菲尔分享这瓶三十年的威士忌吗
Not sharing this 30-year-old scotch with Phil?

247
00:08:27,880 --> 00:08:30,320
他用七喜对着喝 歌洛莉亚
He mixes it with 7up, Gloria.

248
00:08:30,600 --> 00:08:31,780
那简直是仇恨罪
It's a hate crime.

249
00:08:31,980 --> 00:08:33,554
希望这里没有停电
Let's hope the power isn't out here, too.

250
00:08:33,554 --> 00:08:35,140
看起来没问题 门廊的灯亮着
It looks fine. The porch light's on.

251
00:08:35,140 --> 00:08:35,960
火鸡来啦
Turkey coming through!

252
00:08:36,200 --> 00:08:37,660
他们把该死的晚餐挪到这里来了
They moved the damn dinner here.

253
00:08:37,880 --> 00:08:39,280
谢谢你帮我破解密码
Thank you for cracking the code.

254
00:08:40,318 --> 00:08:42,000
把火鸡放到烤箱里 卢克
Pop the turkey in the oven, Luke.

255
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:44,340
损失了点时间 不过如果提高烤箱温度
Lost a little cooking time, but if we crank it to 550,

256
00:08:44,460 --> 00:08:46,820
晚餐应该会按时做好
dinner should be on the table as scheduled.

257
00:08:47,020 --> 00:08:47,560
遵命 主厨
Yes, chef.

258
00:08:49,220 --> 00:08:50,380
这里进行得怎么样了
So, how's it going in here?

259
00:08:50,560 --> 00:08:52,360
耽误了一点时间 不过现在恢复正常了
Minor little speed bump, but we're back on track.

260
00:08:52,420 --> 00:08:53,280
你不用担心
You just relax.

261
00:08:53,380 --> 00:08:55,200
亲爱的 我完全相信你
Honey, I trust you completely.

262
00:08:55,200 --> 00:08:57,380
你有可爱的小助手
You've got your sweaty little helper,

263
00:08:57,400 --> 00:08:59,800
妈妈我也有
and mama has hers.

264
00:09:00,801 --> 00:09:01,923
谢谢
Thanks.

265
00:09:02,380 --> 00:09:04,180
还有多久你才会偷溜回家
So, how long until you sneak home

266
00:09:04,180 --> 00:09:05,020
把后备火鸡拿过来
and get the backup turkey?

267
00:09:05,080 --> 00:09:05,820
有一点信心
Have a little faith.

268
00:09:05,980 --> 00:09:07,560
你真的相信爸爸能做好吗
You're really trusting dad to do this?

269
00:09:07,560 --> 00:09:08,020
对我有信心
In me.

270
00:09:08,340 --> 00:09:10,260
火鸡在车后备箱里莉莉的背包中
It's in Lily's backpack in the trunk of the car.

271
00:09:11,700 --> 00:09:12,720
这简直有病
This is crazy.

272
00:09:12,820 --> 00:09:15,400
我们就下楼告诉他们我们在这里吧
Let's just go downstairs and tell them that we're here.

273
00:09:15,440 --> 00:09:16,060
你开什么玩笑
Are you kidding?

274
00:09:16,520 --> 00:09:18,680
我们从墨西哥给他们发了视频
We sent them a video from Mexico.

275
00:09:18,760 --> 00:09:20,520
我们当着他们的面撒谎
We lied to their faces.

276
00:09:20,900 --> 00:09:22,180
你认为我们就这样下楼
You think we can just go downstairs

277
00:09:22,180 --> 00:09:23,820
扔给他们点钱就能摆平这件事吗
and throw money at this and make it go away?

278
00:09:24,580 --> 00:09:26,438
我在问你呢 这招行不行得通
I'm asking you. Do you think that would work?

279
00:09:26,438 --> 00:09:28,656
我把包落在楼下了 曼尼知道
I left my purse down there, and Manny knows

280
00:09:28,656 --> 00:09:30,560
我不带包绝对不会出门
that I would never leave town without it.

281
00:09:30,560 --> 00:09:31,940
我的钱包和钥匙在吧台上
My wallet and keys are on the bar.

282
00:09:32,200 --> 00:09:33,880
刚才抽的雪茄也在那里
And the cigar I was just smoking.

283
00:09:35,060 --> 00:09:36,140
也许你说得对
Oh, maybe you're right.

284
00:09:37,760 --> 00:09:40,460
大家快来 到外面照相
Come on, everybody! Outside for picture time!

285
00:09:40,720 --> 00:09:43,160
我就知道你不可能是对的
I knew in my heart you couldn't be right.

286
00:09:52,640 --> 00:09:53,700
我去拿杯威士忌
I'm gonna grab a scotch.

287
00:09:53,840 --> 00:09:55,280
谁知道杰把七喜放在哪
Anyone know where Jay keeps the 7up?

288
00:09:59,900 --> 00:10:00,300
好了
Okay.

289
00:10:00,460 --> 00:10:01,960
菲尔 保持冷静
Phil, stay calm.

290
00:10:02,340 --> 00:10:04,620
没错 路上的颠簸把砂锅菜毁了
Yes, the trip over here killed the casserole.

291
00:10:04,680 --> 00:10:06,140
小面包也变硬了
The biscuits are hard.

292
00:10:06,220 --> 00:10:08,620
肉汤上面的皮皱得就像佃农的脖子
The gravy has a skin on it like a sharecropper's neck.

293
00:10:08,720 --> 00:10:10,460
你的洋葱都放进滚水里了吗 菲利普
Are your onions in hot water, Philip?

294
00:10:10,500 --> 00:10:11,560
是的 我觉得我就在滚水里
Yes, I would say they are!

295
00:10:11,780 --> 00:10:13,140
主厨 她只是想帮忙
Chef, she's just trying to help.

296
00:10:13,520 --> 00:10:14,940
没错 还没结束呢
You're right. It's not over.

297
00:10:15,780 --> 00:10:17,400
我们依然可以做出一顿丰盛的晚餐
We can still put a very nice meal...

298
00:10:18,141 --> 00:10:19,680
我把插花忘在车里了
I left the centerpiece in the trunk.

299
00:10:19,680 --> 00:10:20,580
会枯萎的
It's gonna get all wilted.

300
00:10:22,240 --> 00:10:22,840
你要去哪
Where you going?

301
00:10:23,240 --> 00:10:24,460
-一切进展得还顺利吗 -很好
- Everything okay in there? - Peachy.

302
00:10:24,640 --> 00:10:25,880
我把插花忘在车里了
I left the centerpiece in the trunk.

303
00:10:26,660 --> 00:10:27,360
你要去哪
Where are you going?

304
00:10:27,420 --> 00:10:28,254
我去弄点冰块
I was gonna go get some ice.

305
00:10:28,254 --> 00:10:29,560
可以 我去帮你拿
Well, that's okay. I can go get it for you.

306
00:10:29,560 --> 00:10:30,740
很好 我去帮你拿插花
Great. I can get your centerpiece.

307
00:10:30,840 --> 00:10:32,180
我会把冰块放在那张桌子上的
I'll leave your ice right there on that table.

308
00:10:32,260 --> 00:10:33,480
我也会把插花放在那里的
Which is where I will leave your centerpiece.

309
00:10:33,760 --> 00:10:34,700
好吧
Okay, then.

310
00:10:40,020 --> 00:10:42,540
不不不
Oh, no, no, no, no, no!

311
00:10:44,420 --> 00:10:46,960
我想对之前发神经的事向你道歉
So, I want to apologize for flipping out before.

312
00:10:47,100 --> 00:10:48,540
你当然不是色狼
Of course you're not a perv.

313
00:10:48,580 --> 00:10:50,064
-过来 -不 没事的
- Come here. - No, it's okay.

314
00:10:50,064 --> 00:10:51,000
-不 我不能 -来嘛
- No, I couldn't. - Come here.

315
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:51,480
没事的
It's okay.

316
00:10:53,860 --> 00:10:54,700
那是什么
What is that?

317
00:10:54,760 --> 00:10:55,940
-没什么 -别这样
- Oh, nothing. - No.

318
00:10:56,400 --> 00:10:57,700
乍一看 挺像...
For a second, it looked like...

319
00:10:59,880 --> 00:11:00,500
天啊
Oh, my God!

320
00:11:00,500 --> 00:11:01,640
你拿了我的内裤
You have my underwear?!

321
00:11:01,740 --> 00:11:03,000
不 好吧 是的
No. Okay, well, yes,

322
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:03,981
可不是你想的那样
but it's not what you're thinking.

323
00:11:03,981 --> 00:11:05,440
它们本来在我的裤子里
Uh, they were in my pants.

324
00:11:05,440 --> 00:11:06,760
你搞什么啊
What is wrong with you?!

325
00:11:06,780 --> 00:11:08,060
我知道你迷恋我
I know you have a crush on me,

326
00:11:08,060 --> 00:11:09,320
可这样也太痴汉了
but this is, like, deep freak!

327
00:11:09,340 --> 00:11:10,740
不 我曾经迷恋过你
No, I used to have a crush on you,

328
00:11:10,740 --> 00:11:11,500
不过现在不会了
but not anymore.

329
00:11:11,740 --> 00:11:12,940
我就是运气不好
This is all just bad luck.

330
00:11:13,020 --> 00:11:14,220
快拿着你的内裤走人吧
Just take your panties and go.

331
00:11:15,691 --> 00:11:17,720
你们在重现当年的朝圣者
Re-creating the quaint part of the pilgrim story

332
00:11:17,720 --> 00:11:19,140
拿内裤换玉米的诡异情节吗
where they trade underwear for corn?

333
00:11:19,840 --> 00:11:20,600
天啊
Oh, my God.

334
00:11:21,760 --> 00:11:23,200
这样也没那么糟嘛
This is not that terrible.

335
00:11:23,280 --> 00:11:24,480
没错 我们喝着小酒
True. We have drinks.

336
00:11:25,440 --> 00:11:26,360
乔在玩他的小玩具
Joe's playing with his "H."

337
00:11:27,060 --> 00:11:27,840
大家都很开心
Everybody's happy.

338
00:11:27,861 --> 00:11:28,880
干杯
Sí.

339
00:11:29,360 --> 00:11:31,400
我们为啥要去我爸的卧室
And why are we going into my dad's bedroom?

340
00:11:31,620 --> 00:11:32,580
开什么玩笑
You've got to be kidding me.

341
00:11:33,980 --> 00:11:35,999
莉莉觉得自己想穿什么就可以穿什么
Lily thinks she can wear whatever she wants,

342
00:11:35,999 --> 00:11:36,720
所以要是我们
so what if we --

343
00:11:36,720 --> 00:11:37,640
不 不 我才不要穿
No, no, I am not putting on

344
00:11:37,640 --> 00:11:38,980
我爸那些丑不拉几的休闲裤
one of my dad's hideous leisure suits.

345
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:40,280
没让你穿那个 放松
That is not the plan. Relax.

346
00:11:40,340 --> 00:11:41,900
你还记得去年我们从克莱尔家的晚餐上
Do you remember last year when we picked her up

347
00:11:41,900 --> 00:11:43,220
把她接回来的时候
from that family dinner at Claire's?

348
00:11:43,380 --> 00:11:44,540
我们当时为胡娇的八十年代女士派对
We were dressed as Cagney and Lacey

349
00:11:44,540 --> 00:11:46,620
穿成警花拍档的样子 她当时就翻脸了
for Pepper's '80s Ladies Party, and she flipped out.

350
00:11:46,640 --> 00:11:48,180
你不是要穿歌洛莉亚的裙子吧
You're not putting on one of Gloria's dresses.

351
00:11:48,180 --> 00:11:50,740
你就不能让我说完嘛
If you would simply just let me finish,

352
00:11:50,740 --> 00:11:52,680
-计划不是那样的 -好吧 抱歉
- that is not the plan. - Okay, I'm sorry.

353
00:11:52,760 --> 00:11:53,860
我们都要穿裙子
We're both putting on dresses.

354
00:11:53,920 --> 00:11:55,240
不 我才不要这么做
No, I am not doing this.

355
00:11:55,360 --> 00:11:57,740
米奇尔 就我一个人穿是没有效果的
Mitchell, it won't have any impact if I do it by myself.

356
00:11:57,740 --> 00:11:59,960
我保证要是没有作用我们就按你说的做
I promise if it doesn't work, we'll do it your way.

357
00:12:00,880 --> 00:12:02,320
这整个计划里我唯一喜欢的部分
You know, the only part of this I like

358
00:12:02,320 --> 00:12:03,560
就是参观衣帽间
is getting to see this closet.

359
00:12:03,640 --> 00:12:05,000
米尔奇 专心点
Mitchell, focus on the goal.

360
00:12:05,100 --> 00:12:06,280
你知道她那么穿衣服
You know she only dresses the way

361
00:12:06,280 --> 00:12:07,360
只是为了吸引眼球
she does to get attention.

362
00:12:07,820 --> 00:12:09,380
几年前可能还挺可爱的
Maybe it was cute a few years ago,

363
00:12:09,380 --> 00:12:11,680
可现在她已经老得不适合卖萌了
but she's just getting too old for this.

364
00:12:11,840 --> 00:12:13,680
打她一顿屁股就好了
You know what she needs is a good spank on the bottom.

365
00:12:13,780 --> 00:12:15,760
不行 这是你爸的方式
No, that's your father's way.

366
00:12:16,135 --> 00:12:18,353
你是这么告诉他们的吗
You told them about that?

367
00:12:18,400 --> 00:12:20,200
跟你说 要是我有这么个衣帽间
I'm telling you, if I had this closet,

368
00:12:20,200 --> 00:12:21,700
我根本就不会出来[出柜]
I never would have come out.

369
00:12:21,800 --> 00:12:23,200
你以后还可以再来
Well, you can come back later.

370
00:12:23,240 --> 00:12:24,980
我们先把这事儿解决了
Let's just get this over with.

371
00:12:27,700 --> 00:12:30,220
如果那两个贱姑娘有话想跟我说
If those mean girls have something to say to me,

372
00:12:30,220 --> 00:12:31,540
他们就该当着我说
they should say it to my face.

373
00:12:31,540 --> 00:12:32,700
一件事一件事慢慢来
One problem at a time.

374
00:12:32,700 --> 00:12:33,920
你也听到了 他们还会回来
You heard them. They're coming back.

375
00:12:34,100 --> 00:12:35,320
我们得离开这里
We've got to get out of here.

376
00:12:35,340 --> 00:12:36,120
然后去哪里
And go where?

377
00:12:36,260 --> 00:12:37,480
我们从后面的楼梯偷溜出去
We'll sneak down the back stairs.

378
00:12:37,560 --> 00:12:38,740
再跑到前面的走廊去
We'll run around to the front porch

379
00:12:38,740 --> 00:12:41,180
假装为了和大家团聚提前结束旅游回来了
and pretend we cut our trip short to be with everybody.

380
00:12:41,380 --> 00:12:43,260
你赶快拿上外套和尿布
Now, you grab your coat, get the diaper bag.

381
00:12:43,380 --> 00:12:45,540
我去拿几个行李箱 门口见
I'll grab a couple of suitcases, and I'll meet you there.

382
00:13:02,140 --> 00:13:03,600
宝贝 你在读什么呢
Hey, sweetie, what are you reading?

383
00:13:04,480 --> 00:13:05,460
你这穿的什么啊
What are you wearing?

384
00:13:05,660 --> 00:13:06,660
我觉得是杜嘉班纳牌的
Well, I think it's Dolce & Gabbana.

385
00:13:06,700 --> 00:13:07,600
她问你穿的是什么 不是牌子
She asked "What," not "Who."

386
00:13:07,620 --> 00:13:08,440
你看到红地毯了吗
Do you see red carpet?

387
00:13:08,500 --> 00:13:10,240
我们就在男生的衣服外面
Oh, well, we're just wearing dresses

388
00:13:10,240 --> 00:13:11,920
套上裙子 跟你一样
over our boy clothes, like you.

389
00:13:12,000 --> 00:13:13,300
不 我忘了
Oh, no, I forgot.

390
00:13:13,340 --> 00:13:15,840
我们穿裙子你会不高兴 对吧
Us wearing dresses upsets you, doesn't it?

391
00:13:15,920 --> 00:13:16,840
没错
Yeah, it does.

392
00:13:17,580 --> 00:13:19,000
我们不想让你难受的
I don't want to make her uncomfortable,

393
00:13:19,020 --> 00:13:21,120
可我们有权决定自己想穿什么
but we should be able to wear whatever we want.

394
00:13:21,780 --> 00:13:24,720
怎么办 怎么办
what to do, what to do?

395
00:13:24,880 --> 00:13:27,000
我不敢相信我居然穿得进歌洛莉亚的裙子
I just can't believe I slipped into one of Gloria's dresses.

396
00:13:27,040 --> 00:13:28,260
别臭美了 那是件孕期斗篷
Relax. It's a maternity poncho.

397
00:13:30,440 --> 00:13:32,823
好了 我们就说做了中午的航班回来
Okay, we tell them we took the noon flight out,

398
00:13:32,823 --> 00:13:34,341
然后 乔呢
and, uh -- where's Joe?

399
00:13:35,020 --> 00:13:36,600
我以为是你带他的
I thought you were bringing him!

400
00:13:36,600 --> 00:13:37,700
我拉着两个箱子
I'm lugging two suitcases.

401
00:13:37,980 --> 00:13:39,121
空箱子
Empty suitcases!

402
00:13:39,121 --> 00:13:40,801
我们怎么能进去却没带着...
How are we gonna walk in there without...?

403
00:13:41,020 --> 00:13:42,080
那只小火鸡
The little turkey!

404
00:13:42,220 --> 00:13:43,800
我不喜欢你这么叫他
I don't like you calling him that.

405
00:13:43,800 --> 00:13:45,588
不 我说的是我正在做的那个小火鸡
No, no, the little turkey I was cooking for us.

406
00:13:45,588 --> 00:13:46,762
还在烤箱里呢
It's still in the oven.

407
00:13:46,860 --> 00:13:47,300
好吧
Okay.

408
00:13:48,940 --> 00:13:51,260
我就说我要送乔上楼睡觉
I'll say I have to put Joe down for a nap,

409
00:13:51,260 --> 00:13:52,780
你负责处理掉火鸡
And you get rid of the turkey.

410
00:13:53,040 --> 00:13:56,340
我只是说你很生气我忘了乔
I'm just saying you get very mad because I forgot Joe,

411
00:13:56,440 --> 00:13:57,558
可是一提到火鸡...
but when it comes to turkey --

412
00:13:57,558 --> 00:13:59,102
现在没时间说这个
I don't have time for thess.

413
00:13:59,380 --> 00:14:01,040
如果莉莉看到了很不爽
No, if it really bothers Lily,

414
00:14:01,140 --> 00:14:02,400
那我们就该改变了 小卡
then we should change, Cam,

415
00:14:02,440 --> 00:14:04,440
这样莉莉可能也会考虑...
and then maybe Lily will also consider --

416
00:14:04,720 --> 00:14:05,620
大家好啊
Hola, family!

417
00:14:06,020 --> 00:14:08,760
我们想你们了 所以提前回来
We came back early because we miss you.

418
00:14:08,840 --> 00:14:09,780
我们看见车停在外面
We saw the cars.

419
00:14:09,860 --> 00:14:11,200
怎么了 你们把聚餐改在这里了吗
What, did you move the party here?

420
00:14:11,380 --> 00:14:12,307
是啊 好久不见
Yes! Hello!

421
00:14:12,307 --> 00:14:14,020
老爸 听着
So, hey, d-dad, listen,

422
00:14:14,020 --> 00:14:15,420
我们之所以穿着这些裙子 是因为
the reason that we're wearing these dresses...

423
00:14:15,420 --> 00:14:16,440
你们开心就好
Do what you got to do.

424
00:14:16,600 --> 00:14:18,380
我现在得把这小家伙送上床
I got to get this little guy up to bed

425
00:14:18,380 --> 00:14:20,500
他有点晕机
because that plane ride really knocked him out.

426
00:14:20,780 --> 00:14:21,509
天哪
Oh, my God!

427
00:14:21,509 --> 00:14:23,100
他没事的 你看他都没哭
He's fine. See? Not crying.

428
00:14:23,100 --> 00:14:24,649
这可不一定是好兆头
That's not necessarily a good thing.

429
00:14:24,649 --> 00:14:26,460
我要把行李拿到洗衣房去
And I'm gonna take the luggage to the laundry

430
00:14:26,460 --> 00:14:28,440
因为墨西哥实在太脏了
because Mexico is very dirty.

431
00:14:29,780 --> 00:14:31,040
爸和歌洛莉亚看见我们穿裙子
Dad and Gloria seem really okay

432
00:14:31,040 --> 00:14:31,980
居然没有大惊小怪
with us wearing dresses.

433
00:14:32,180 --> 00:14:33,920
是啊 我们又不是天天这样
Yeah, like we do it every day?

434
00:14:34,080 --> 00:14:37,120
如果外公没意见 我也不介意
Well, if it's okay with grandpa, it's okay with me.

435
00:15:01,420 --> 00:15:03,420
红莓酱好了
The cranberry sauce is okay,

436
00:15:03,440 --> 00:15:05,900
肉汁也终于做好了
and the gravy is out of the woods.

437
00:15:06,120 --> 00:15:07,117
由于你的心灵手巧
And, thanks to you,

438
00:15:07,117 --> 00:15:09,080
那些小胡萝卜也应该没问题了
those baby carrots are gonna pull through.

439
00:15:09,080 --> 00:15:10,060
它们还真是顽强
Well, they're fighters.

440
00:15:10,280 --> 00:15:12,220
菲利普 最后一次
And now, Phillip, for the last time,

441
00:15:12,340 --> 00:15:13,997
用油轻轻地刷一次大腿
lightly brush the thighs.

442
00:15:13,997 --> 00:15:16,936
我会想念这个红色小抹布的
I'm gonna miss this randy little redcoat.

443
00:15:17,240 --> 00:15:19,160
但我们还是要走到最后那一步
But it's time to cross the finish line.

444
00:15:21,500 --> 00:15:21,980
不
No!

445
00:15:22,460 --> 00:15:22,900
怎么了
What?!

446
00:15:23,460 --> 00:15:25,979
我调高了烤箱温度 火鸡被烤缩水了
Cranking up the heat must have dried it up and shrunk it!

447
00:15:25,979 --> 00:15:27,499
变得这么小了
It's tiny!

448
00:15:31,220 --> 00:15:34,680
就这一只"鸽子"我怎么喂得饱11个人
How am I supposed to feed 11 people with this pigeon?!

449
00:15:35,300 --> 00:15:36,540
老爸 火鸡做得怎么样了
Hey, dad, how's it coming?

450
00:15:36,780 --> 00:15:37,180
很棒
Great!

451
00:15:38,880 --> 00:15:41,280
再给我几分钟就可以上桌了
Just some last-minute touches, and we're good to go.

452
00:15:41,880 --> 00:15:42,220
很好
Great.

453
00:15:45,780 --> 00:15:46,457
他已经败走火鸡镇了
Panic in turkey town.

454
00:15:46,457 --> 00:15:47,940
备用火鸡在莉莉的背包里
The backup turkey's in Lily's book bag.

455
00:15:47,940 --> 00:15:48,880
把背包拿给我 我来搞定
Bring it to me. I'll do the rest.

456
00:15:48,980 --> 00:15:50,140
从没觉得这么活力充沛过
I've never felt so alive.

457
00:15:50,480 --> 00:15:53,319
我想再次跟你道歉
Hey, so, I want to try and apologize again.

458
00:15:53,319 --> 00:15:55,340
没关系 都是我的错
It's okay. It was, it was all my fault.

459
00:15:55,340 --> 00:15:57,000
这只是场意外而已
No, no, it was an accident.

460
00:15:57,080 --> 00:15:58,260
-我们之间没问题 -谢谢
- We're good. - Thanks.

461
00:15:58,840 --> 00:16:00,900
为了把事情一次性说清楚
And just to wrap things up once and for all,

462
00:16:00,900 --> 00:16:02,920
当时大家都太激动了
some things were said in the heat of the moment

463
00:16:02,920 --> 00:16:03,480
有些话不是真心的
that weren't really meant.

464
00:16:03,480 --> 00:16:05,060
我知道你没把我当成变态
I know you don't think I'm a perv.

465
00:16:05,180 --> 00:16:06,378
那个是不该说
Yes, that. That.

466
00:16:06,378 --> 00:16:08,420
还有就是你说的
And, and also, that thing about

467
00:16:08,420 --> 00:16:10,068
你不再暗恋我了
you not having a crush on me anymore.

468
00:16:10,068 --> 00:16:11,360
我保证我没有
I-I promise I don't.

469
00:16:11,360 --> 00:16:12,660
曼尼 得了吧
Oh, Manny, come on.

470
00:16:12,660 --> 00:16:14,140
打开天窗说亮话
We're really trying to wrap things up.

471
00:16:14,180 --> 00:16:16,400
我发誓 我现在都很少偷看你
I swear. I barely even look at you anymore.

472
00:16:16,560 --> 00:16:17,540
这是从什么时候开始的
Well, when did that happen?

473
00:16:17,560 --> 00:16:18,680
是从我把头发漂染之后吗
Was it when I lightened my hair?

474
00:16:18,740 --> 00:16:19,580
浅色的头发让我黯然失色 对吗
It washes me out, right?

475
00:16:19,580 --> 00:16:20,660
别人也这么觉得吗
Do other people feel this way?

476
00:16:22,020 --> 00:16:22,420
海莉
Haley,

477
00:16:23,240 --> 00:16:26,740
你是个美丽的女人 在你安定下来之前
you are a beautiful woman who will break many hearts

478
00:16:26,740 --> 00:16:28,800
你会伤透很多人的心 包括我的
before you're done, mine among them.

479
00:16:32,140 --> 00:16:34,060
你刚刚只是想"拥抱" 对吧
You meant "hug," didn't you?

480
00:16:34,440 --> 00:16:35,629
真抱歉
I'm, I'm sorry.

481
00:16:42,520 --> 00:16:44,220
我们需要一个小一点的盘子
We need a smaller platter or something

482
00:16:44,220 --> 00:16:45,820
让这只火鸡看起来是正常大小
that makes this look normal-sized!

483
00:16:45,820 --> 00:16:47,300
用杯垫怎么样
How do you feel about a coaster?

484
00:16:47,868 --> 00:16:49,536
拿这个做三明治的火鸡片来充充数
Fill it in with this sandwich turkey.

485
00:16:49,536 --> 00:16:50,660
我知道这已经过期了
It's past its sell-by date,

486
00:16:50,660 --> 00:16:52,380
但我一直觉得保质期只是供参考而已
but I always think that's more of a suggestion, anyway.

487
00:16:52,480 --> 00:16:53,780
我先去用面包把他们都喂饱
I'm gonna get them all loaded up on bread.

488
00:16:54,100 --> 00:16:55,120
菲利普 接下来
And now, Philip,

489
00:16:55,180 --> 00:16:56,840
你要怎么处理剩下的食材呢
what to do with all the leftovers.

490
00:16:57,200 --> 00:16:59,100
我之前下载的那个甜心去哪了
What happened to the sweet girl I downloaded?

491
00:17:00,660 --> 00:17:02,117
你跟女儿说清楚没有
So, did you have it out with our daughter?

492
00:17:02,117 --> 00:17:04,680
要知道 今天是节日 我...
Well, you know, it's a holiday, and I...

493
00:17:04,680 --> 00:17:06,120
好 那我来吧
Fine! I will handle this.

494
00:17:06,280 --> 00:17:08,340
我就唱一辈子白脸好了
I will be the permanent bad guy in this family

495
00:17:08,660 --> 00:17:10,720
就因为你太怕女儿会不喜欢你
cause you're so afraid of our daughter not liking you.

496
00:17:10,780 --> 00:17:11,720
我就是想告诉你
But just so you know,

497
00:17:12,020 --> 00:17:14,460
我的父母里 有一个想成为我的朋友
I had one parent growing up who wanted to be my friend

498
00:17:14,460 --> 00:17:16,240
一个并不关心他是不是我的朋友
and another one who didn't care about that.

499
00:17:16,640 --> 00:17:18,340
猜猜现在哪个还经常和我在一起
Guess which one is still in my life.

500
00:17:19,380 --> 00:17:20,540
要来点美味的自制面包吗
Delicious homemade bread?

501
00:17:21,180 --> 00:17:22,400
这就是普通的白面包啊
That looks like just regular white bread.

502
00:17:22,400 --> 00:17:24,220
你们俩好像喝醉了 这能解酒
You two seem drunk. This will soak up the booze.

503
00:17:25,180 --> 00:17:25,580
我喝醉了吗
Am I?

504
00:17:27,020 --> 00:17:28,640
艾丽克斯 等等
Oh, Alex. Wait.

505
00:17:29,160 --> 00:17:29,560
莉莉
Lily.

506
00:17:30,000 --> 00:17:31,660
艾丽克斯把你的背包拿来给你了
Alex brought your backpack in for you.

507
00:17:31,660 --> 00:17:33,240
你何不把它拿到我们的车上去呢
So why don't you go ahead and take it out to our car?

508
00:17:33,440 --> 00:17:34,220
晚点再说吧
Maybe later.

509
00:17:34,740 --> 00:17:35,494
莉莉 不行
No, Lily!

510
00:17:35,494 --> 00:17:37,380
没关系的 我来吧
It's okay. I will take it now.

511
00:17:37,380 --> 00:17:38,860
艾丽克斯 给我把包放下
Alex, put the backpack down!

512
00:17:40,360 --> 00:17:40,760
老妈
Mom!

513
00:17:41,380 --> 00:17:43,800
莉莉 衣着 早餐 还有其他事
Lily, you are not in charge of what you wear,

514
00:17:44,000 --> 00:17:45,320
都不是你说了算
of breakfast, or anything.

515
00:17:45,320 --> 00:17:49,240
现在 背上背包 朝着我们的车进发
Now, put that backpack on and march it out to the car!

516
00:17:50,060 --> 00:17:51,160
这包太重了
It's too heavy.

517
00:17:51,220 --> 00:17:52,500
生活是艰难的
Well, that's tough

518
00:17:52,500 --> 00:17:54,140
因为以后我不会再帮你背着包了
because I'm not carrying it for you anymore!

519
00:17:54,840 --> 00:17:57,260
我喜欢全新的你
I like this new guy, huh?

520
00:17:59,740 --> 00:18:01,540
瞧吧 我就跟你们说太重了吧
See? I told you it was too heavy.

521
00:18:01,600 --> 00:18:03,760
天啊 这包里到底装了什么啊
My gosh, what in the world is in this?!

522
00:18:04,200 --> 00:18:04,640
不要
No!

523
00:18:05,460 --> 00:18:07,540
克莱尔 我们落在你家的背包里
Claire, why is there a fully cooked turkey

524
00:18:07,540 --> 00:18:08,960
怎么突然多了一只烤好的火鸡
in the backpack we left at your house?

525
00:18:09,000 --> 00:18:10,260
是啊 克莱尔 怎么会出现的呢
Yes, Claire, why is there?

526
00:18:10,300 --> 00:18:11,340
会不会是因为你烤了个备用的
Could it be you made a backup

527
00:18:11,340 --> 00:18:13,360
因为你根本不相信我能做好这顿晚餐
because you never trusted me with the dinner at all?

528
00:18:13,400 --> 00:18:15,286
我觉得有可能...
Well, I thought there was a chance that --

529
00:18:15,286 --> 00:18:16,553
有可能我会搞砸一切吗
What, that I'd screw everything up?

530
00:18:16,580 --> 00:18:17,800
你知道吗 我郑重告诉你
You know what? I have half a mind

531
00:18:17,800 --> 00:18:19,660
我打算把我做的美味晚餐装好...
to pack up the beautiful meal I made --

532
00:18:19,700 --> 00:18:21,340
晚餐上来啦
Dinner is served!

533
00:18:22,320 --> 00:18:23,940
我 我不明白
I-I-I don't -- I don't understand.

534
00:18:23,940 --> 00:18:25,180
是每个人都分到那样一盘吗
Does everybody get one?

535
00:18:25,900 --> 00:18:28,480
我只是想着 万一你遇到麻烦
I was just going to sub in my turkey

536
00:18:28,480 --> 00:18:31,420
我就献上我的火鸡 我的意思是...
if you got in trouble, which, I mean...

537
00:18:31,420 --> 00:18:32,260
既然你已经碰了
Well, now you touched it,

538
00:18:32,260 --> 00:18:34,040
那你就和艾丽克斯还有海莉分享那只吧
so you, Alex, and Haley will share that one.

539
00:18:34,140 --> 00:18:36,020
黑肉献给你黑暗不信任别人的灵魂
Dark meat for your dark, untrusting soul.

540
00:18:36,160 --> 00:18:36,440
菲尔
Phil!

541
00:18:36,480 --> 00:18:38,460
话说这可是个崭新的背包
You know, this was a brand-new backpack,

542
00:18:38,540 --> 00:18:40,600
现在里面却全都是烤火鸡的酱汁
and now it's got turkey juice all up in it!

543
00:18:40,620 --> 00:18:41,820
行了 冷静点 大嗓门
Okay, back it up, old yeller.

544
00:18:41,940 --> 00:18:43,300
好了 都少说两句吧
Okay, could we just stop?

545
00:18:43,300 --> 00:18:45,480
天啊 这可是感恩节
This is Thanksgiving, for god's sake.

546
00:18:45,760 --> 00:18:48,499
更别提明天还是卢克的生日呢
And not to mention that tomorrow is Luke's birthday.

547
00:18:48,499 --> 00:18:50,760
对了 这个行李箱里有送给我的礼物吧
Hey, this is the suitcase with my present, right?

548
00:18:50,760 --> 00:18:51,740
你们在视频里说了的
You had it in the video.

549
00:18:52,180 --> 00:18:52,700
不要
No!

550
00:18:53,840 --> 00:18:54,820
搞什么鬼
What the hell?!

551
00:18:57,240 --> 00:18:58,280
恭喜你 卢克
Congratulations, Luke!

552
00:18:58,540 --> 00:19:00,060
你终于长大成人了
You're finally a man!

553
00:19:00,180 --> 00:19:02,700
在我的祖国 人们16岁生日时
In my country, when you turn 16,

554
00:19:02,840 --> 00:19:04,020
会收到火鸡
you get your turkey.

555
00:19:04,200 --> 00:19:05,360
等等 那段视频
Wait, you made the video

556
00:19:05,360 --> 00:19:06,900
是你们在决定提早回来之前就拍摄好了的
before you decided to come back early.

557
00:19:07,140 --> 00:19:09,100
你们难道打算把火鸡放里面4天吗
Were you gonna keep the turkey in there for four days?

558
00:19:09,880 --> 00:19:11,460
那是种传统
It's a tradition.

559
00:19:11,460 --> 00:19:14,260
你是怎么带着那玩意儿过海关的啊
How did you get that thing through customs?

560
00:19:15,560 --> 00:19:17,040
那可是海关部门[风俗]
It is called customs.

561
00:19:17,280 --> 00:19:19,640
他们 很尊重传统风俗
They...respect customs.

562
00:19:19,760 --> 00:19:20,200
等等
Wait a minute.

563
00:19:20,920 --> 00:19:21,820
我认识这只火鸡
I know this bird.

564
00:19:22,540 --> 00:19:24,140
我给这对鸡胸上油一整天了
I've been oiling these breasts all day.

565
00:19:24,360 --> 00:19:25,600
这是我的火鸡
This is my turkey!

566
00:19:25,920 --> 00:19:27,440
烤得很完美
Done to perfection!

567
00:19:27,620 --> 00:19:28,520
吃了吧 克莱尔
Eat it, Claire!

568
00:19:28,800 --> 00:19:30,980
等等 爸爸的火鸡怎么会
Wait, so, how did dad's turkey

569
00:19:30,980 --> 00:19:32,020
进他们的行李箱
get in their suitcase?

570
00:19:32,160 --> 00:19:33,920
那个小火鸡又是从哪儿来的
And where did that small turkey come from?

571
00:19:33,980 --> 00:19:35,100
你们怎么知道要回来这里的
And how did you know to come here?

572
00:19:35,180 --> 00:19:36,220
晚餐本该是在克莱尔家举行的
Dinner was supposed to be at Claire's.

573
00:19:36,400 --> 00:19:37,760
好了 好了
All right, all right.

574
00:19:37,760 --> 00:19:39,440
乱得跟电影《凯恩号哗变》里的情节一样
It's like "The Caine Mutiny" In here!

575
00:19:39,440 --> 00:19:41,700
我们的度假在最后时刻被取消了
Our vacation got canceled at the last minute.

576
00:19:41,840 --> 00:19:43,480
我们决定对你们隐瞒这事
We decided not to say anything

577
00:19:43,480 --> 00:19:44,626
因为我们想躲着清静一下
because we wanted a break.

578
00:19:44,626 --> 00:19:46,340
躲着什么啊
A br-- a break from what?!

579
00:19:46,340 --> 00:19:48,037
躲着感恩节的疯狂
From Thanksgiving craziness.

580
00:19:48,037 --> 00:19:50,660
比如压力 吼叫
From -- from stress, from yelling,

581
00:19:50,660 --> 00:19:52,339
以及这二位穿着裙子晃荡
from these two parading around in dresses.

582
00:19:52,339 --> 00:19:54,000
-一次而已 -我们在家可不穿裙子
- That was a one-time thing. - Okay, we don't wear dresses at home.

583
00:19:54,000 --> 00:19:56,300
听着 我知道感恩节
Now, look, I get that Thanksgiving

584
00:19:56,300 --> 00:19:57,440
对于那些长年见不到的
is a big day for families

585
00:19:57,440 --> 00:19:58,580
家人们来说是一件大事
who never see each other,

586
00:19:58,591 --> 00:20:01,100
但我们这个家的人几乎时刻都黏在一起
but this group is together non-stop.

587
00:20:01,100 --> 00:20:04,720
不如你们把行李箱里的这只火鸡带回家
Look, why don't you take the suitcase turkey home with you?

588
00:20:05,140 --> 00:20:06,760
你们把备用火鸡带回家
You take the backpack turkey.

589
00:20:06,860 --> 00:20:08,981
我们叫披萨外卖 今晚就到此为止吧
We'll order a pizza, and we'll all call it a night.

590
00:20:08,981 --> 00:20:10,384
-好啊 是个好主意 -好吧 行
- Fine. That sounds great. - All right. Okay, fine.

591
00:20:10,384 --> 00:20:11,680
不 不 不要
No, no, no, no, no, no, no, no!

592
00:20:11,680 --> 00:20:13,780
我知道我一般不会说这种话的
I know I seem like the last person to say this,

593
00:20:13,780 --> 00:20:15,700
但我们不能直接略过感恩节啊
but we can't just skip Thanksgiving!

594
00:20:16,100 --> 00:20:17,840
时光飞逝啊
Time is going by so fast.

595
00:20:18,040 --> 00:20:20,500
似乎就在昨天 曼尼还对我一往情深
It seemed like only yesterday that Manny was hot for me,

596
00:20:20,500 --> 00:20:21,420
现在却完全没有了
and he's not anymore.

597
00:20:21,480 --> 00:20:23,420
某天 艾丽克斯也会有个男朋友
And someday, Alex may have a boyfriend

598
00:20:23,420 --> 00:20:25,300
他会希望带她回他家去过感恩节
who wants her to spend it with his family.

599
00:20:25,720 --> 00:20:27,360
好吧 那或许还需要等上几年
Okay, we probably got a little window there.

600
00:20:27,360 --> 00:20:29,820
但我想说的是 我爱我疯狂的家人们
But my point is that I love my crazy family,

601
00:20:29,820 --> 00:20:32,080
我想跟我的家人们一起过这个感恩节
and I want to spend this holiday with them.

602
00:20:33,900 --> 00:20:35,870
如果你们想清静 我们可以略过圣诞节
If you want a break, we can skip Christmas.

603
00:20:35,870 --> 00:20:37,617
-行吧 就这么定了 -好吧
- Fine. Settled. - Okay.

604
00:20:37,902 --> 00:20:39,700
-那就略过圣诞节吧 -好吧 行
- Skip Christmas. - Okay. cool.

605
00:20:39,700 --> 00:20:41,540
我早计划好和我的朋友们
I already had plans to spend Christmas

606
00:20:41,540 --> 00:20:42,640
去卡波过圣诞节了
in cabo with my friends.

607
00:20:43,560 --> 00:20:45,300
我必须想个办法脱身
I've got to get out of here.

608
00:20:48,536 --> 00:20:50,580
我们为什么要把三只火鸡都吃掉啊
Why did we eat all three turkeys?

609
00:20:50,580 --> 00:20:53,040
我希望明年的圣诞节是在周五
I hope that Thanksgiving's on a Friday next year,

610
00:20:53,040 --> 00:20:55,020
那样我整个周末就可以一直睡了
so that I can sleep through the entire weekend.

611
00:20:56,500 --> 00:20:58,960
妈 你能教化一下她吗 我实在累了
Mom, can you take this one? I'm exhausted.

612
00:20:59,200 --> 00:21:00,800
你肯定是累坏了
Wow, you really must be.

613
00:21:01,940 --> 00:21:03,420
菲尔 省省吧
Phil, give it up.

614
00:21:04,020 --> 00:21:06,480
亲爱的 无论你怎么跳舞
Honey, you can dance all you want,

615
00:21:06,480 --> 00:21:08,220
但你骗不了任何人
but you're not fooling anyone.

616
00:21:08,520 --> 00:21:10,320
继续大力搅拌[鞭打]吧 菲利普
Continue to whip vigorously, Philip,

617
00:21:10,440 --> 00:21:12,320
直到你的蛋白面糊[精液]变粘稠
until your meringue stiffens.

618
00:21:12,500 --> 00:21:13,580
真好笑啊 我可没有...
That's hilarious. I don't --

619
00:21:13,580 --> 00:21:15,280
面皮表层[屁股]变成漂亮的粉红色了吗
Are the cheeks turning nice and pink?

620
00:21:15,440 --> 00:21:16,340
到底是出什么毛病了
What's the problem?

621
00:21:16,700 --> 00:21:18,540
现在请置入冷水中
Now plunge into cold water.

622
00:21:18,680 --> 00:21:20,780
我刚刚正打算建议你做同样的事呢
I was just about to suggest the same thing.
